[ti:Ow!]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.65]Lesson 99 | 第99课
[00:02.85]Ow! | 哎哟!
[00:04.74]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:10.49]Must Andy go to see the doctor? | 安迪必须去看医生吗?
[00:15.56]Ow! | 哎哟!
[00:17.05]What's the matter, Andy? | 安迪,怎么了?
[00:20.06]I slipped and fell downstairs. | 我滑了一跤,从楼梯上摔了下来。
[00:23.62]Have you hurt yourself? | 你伤到自己了吗?
[00:26.46]Yes, I have. | 是的,我伤了。
[00:28.48]I think that I've hurt my back. | 我想我伤到了背。
[00:32.54]Try and stand up. | 试着站起来。
[00:35.29]Can you stand up? | 你能站起来吗?
[00:37.45]Here. | 这儿。
[00:38.53]Let me help you. | 让我来帮你。
[00:41.51]I'm sorry, Lucy. | 很抱歉,露西。
[00:43.99]I'm afraid that I can't get up. | 恐怕我站不起来。
[00:48.04]I think that the doctor had better see you. | 我想你最好让医生看看你。
[00:52.97]I'll phone Dr. Carter. | 我给卡特医生打电话。
[00:56.97]The doctor says that he will come at once. | 医生说他马上就来。
[01:01.83]I'm sure that you need an X-ray, Andy. | 我确信你需要照X光,安迪。